t for internals , as well as work from home on\nSaturday (Tommorow)\nTo: &lt;hretherxinnovations@gmail.com&gt;\n\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\nI hope this message finds you well.\nI would like to inform you that I have my internal examinations scheduled\nfrom Monday to Wednesday. Hence, I kindly request leave for the mentioned\ndays.\n\nAdditionally, I would like to request Work From Home for tomorrow\n(Saturday) so that I can effectively focus on my assigned work at EtherX\nInnovations Pvt Ltd while also preparing for my examinations from home.\n\nI assure you that I will stay available online and ensure all\nresponsibilities are managed without any disruption.\n\nThank you for your understanding and support.\n\nSincerely,\nYashwanth Raj\nEtherX Innovations Pvt Ltd\n\n--000000000000947bce0659c6cf7d\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\n&lt;div dir=3D&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=3D&quot;gmail_quote gmail_quote_container&quot;&gt;&lt;=\ndiv dir=3D&quot;ltr&quot; class=3D&quot;gmail_attr&quot;&gt;---------- Forwarded message ---------=\n&lt;br&gt;From: &lt;strong class=3D&quot;gmail_sendername&quot; dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Yashwanth&lt;/strong=\n&gt; &lt;span dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;a href=3D&quot;mailto:yashwanthrajdj33@gmail.com&quot;&gt;yash=\nwanthrajdj33@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Date: Fri, Dec 19, 2025 at 6:54=E2=\n=80=AFPM&lt;br&gt;Subject: Leave Request for internals , as well as work from hom=\ne on Saturday (Tommorow)&lt;br&gt;To:  &amp;lt;&lt;a href=3D&quot;mailto:hretherxinnovations@=\ngmail.com&quot;&gt;hretherxinnovations@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div dir=\n=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Dear Sir/Madam,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;I hope t=\nhis message finds you well.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;I would like to inform y=\nou that I ha